# Generated by `cargo xtask gen-synthetic` (US-RR-10-7) and checked byte for
# byte (and against SHA256SUMS) on Linux and Windows. Git must never rewrite
# these bytes: the ROM images are raw binary, and the manifest and
# SHA256SUMS keep `\n` line endings on every checkout (a Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise turn them into `\r\n`).
*.bin           binary
*.manifest.toml text eol=lf
SHA256SUMS      text eol=lf
